    "created_at": "2021-03-20T11:48:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-20T11:48:40Z",
    "body": "I hope this issue moves forward, but I felt we need to clarify the historical reason to support only `<input type=email multiple>`. We may be able to go to next If the reason is something like \"simply, support only for `<input type=email multiple>` is enough\". Is there any concern like a security issue?\r\n\r\nBesides that, we may need to consider how browsers realize an input includes multiple values. Will attribute like `delimiter` (comma `,` as default) needed?",
